vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit Capacity Building Program Evaluation

  Submits a new capacity building programme evaluation form. The evaluation captures programme details, sponsorship information, participant metrics, logistics ratings, challenges, financial summary, and the evaluator's overall assessment.

  On success, the evaluation record is inserted into the database and cached. The endpoint returns the newly created evaluation object with a `200 OK` status.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.

  ## Request Body (`application/json`)

  ### Programme Details

  | Field              | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                       |
  |--------------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | programName        | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |
  | programType        | string | Yes      | One of: `Professional Program`, `Undergraduates Program`, `Secondary School Program`, `other`       |
  | programDate        | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD`                                                                      |
  | location           | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |
  | programCoordinator | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |

  ### Sponsorship & Partnerships

  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | numberOfSponsors     | number | Yes      | Numeric value                                                                               |
  | listOfSponsors       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                              |
  | sponsorshipType      | string | Yes      | One of: `Financial`, `Materials/Equipment`, `Venue Support`, `Technical Expertise`, `Other`  |
  | partnerOrganizations | string | No       | Optional text                                                                               |
  | partnershipLevel     | string | Yes      | One of: `Planning`, `Funding`, `Implementation`, `Monitoring & Evaluation`, `other`         |

  ### Participant Metrics

  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | numberOfParticipants | number | Yes      | Numeric value                |
  | targetAudience       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | numberOfFacilitators | number | Yes      | Numeric value                |
  | numberOfVolunteers   | number | Yes      | Numeric value                |

  ### Programme Assessment

  | Field                      | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                    |
  |----------------------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------|
  | participantEngagementLevel | string | Yes      | One of: `low`, `moderate`, `high`                               |
  | programObjectives          | string | No       | Optional text                                                   |
  | objectiveAchievement       | string | Yes      | One of: `Fully achieved`, `Partially achieved`, `Not achieved`  |
  | programOutcome             | string | No       | Optional text                                                   |
  | programImpact              | string | No       | Optional text                                                   |
  | majorActivities            | string | No       | Optional text                                                   |
  | effectiveActivities        | string | No       | Optional text                                                   |

  ### Logistics Ratings (1–5 scale)

  | Field                         | Type   | Required | Constraints          |
  |-------------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------|
  | venueSuitability              | number | Yes      | Integer, 1–5         |
  | timeManagement                | number | Yes      | Integer, 1–5         |
  | resourceAvailability          | number | Yes      | Integer, 1–5         |
  | communicationAndCoordination  | number | Yes      | Integer, 1–5         |
  | teamworkAmongOrganizers       | number | Yes      | Integer, 1–5         |

  ### Challenges & Lessons

  | Field                 | Type   | Required | Constraints   |
  |-----------------------|--------|----------|---------------|
  | challengesEncountered | string | No       | Optional text |
  | challengesAddressed   | string | No       | Optional text |
  | lessonsLearned        | string | No       | Optional text |

  ### Financial Summary

  | Field                          | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                              |
  |--------------------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------|
  | budgetAllocated                | string | No       | Optional text                                              |
  | budgetUtilized                 | string | No       | Optional text                                              |
  | wereResourcesAdequate          | string | No       | One of: `yes`, `no` (optional)                             |
  | inadequateResourcesExplanation | string | No       | Optional text — provide if `wereResourcesAdequate` is `no` |

  ### Overall Assessment

  | Field                   | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                |
  |-------------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
  | overallSuccess          | string | No       | One of: `Poor`, `Fair`, `Good`, `Very Good`, `Excellent`     |
  | recommendTheProgram     | string | No       | One of: `yes`, `no`                                          |
  | improvementSuggestions  | string | No       | Optional text                                                |
  | recommendFuturePrograms | string | No       | Optional text                                                |

  ### Evaluator Information

  | Field         | Type   | Required | Constraints                  |
  |---------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | name          | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | role          | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | dateSubmitted | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns the newly created capacity building evaluation record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```

  The created record is also cached under the key `cedarrise:capacity:evaluation:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                                             |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.     |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `create` permission.                           |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                                |
}
